        "text": "# Nginx vhost for set1-owner.test\n# Generated by CelikPanel — do not edit by hand / elle düzenlemeyin\n# Site ID: 1 · Project type: static\nserver {\n    listen 80;\n    listen [::]:80;\n    server_name set1-owner.test www.set1-owner.test;\n\n    access_log /var/log/nginx/set1-owner.test-access.log;\n    error_log /var/log/nginx/set1-owner.test-error.log;\n\n    # Root-owned validation content only; never tenant public_html.\n    location ^~ /.well-known/acme-challenge/ {\n        root /var/lib/celikpanel-agent/acme-http-01/subscriptions/2/domains/1;\n        try_files $uri =404;\n    }\n\n    root /var/www/celikpanel/subscriptions/2/sites/1/public_html;\n    index index.html index.htm;\n\n    location / {\n\n        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;\n    }\n    location ~ \\.(php|phtml|phps|php[0-9])$ {\n        deny all;\n    }\n    location ~ /\\.(?!well-known).* {\n        deny all;\n    }\n}\n",
